  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Valentin Bukhtoyarov is a Russian entrepreneur whose fortune originated in coal mining. An engineering graduate of the Siberian Metallurgical Institute, he began his career in the Kemerovo coalfields. He co-founded Sibuglemet in 1995, overseeing finance and accounting, before selling his stake and becoming a private investor who subsequently invested in oil.",
    "html": "<p>Valentin Bukhtoyarov is a Russian entrepreneur whose fortune originated in coal mining. An engineering graduate of the Siberian Metallurgical Institute, he began his career in the Kemerovo coalfields. He co-founded Sibuglemet in 1995, overseeing finance and accounting, before selling his stake and becoming a private investor who subsequently invested in oil.</p>\r\n",
